  "name": "Hot Spiced Wine",
  "subtitle": "A warm blend of red and white wine with citrus, ginger, and spice",
  "description": "Heat wine with orange, ginger, cinnamon, cloves, and brown sugar, then finish with brandy for a fragrant warm drink.",
